cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Cortical-Column Memory: A Thousand-Brains-Inspired Architecture for Structured Agent Memory"
message: "If you use this research artifact, please cite the v0.1.0 protocol release."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Booth
    given-names: James
    affiliation: Independent researcher
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-04
repository-code: "https://github.com/jmsbooth/cortical-column-memory"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A model-agnostic, agent-internal memory architecture and preregistered
  evaluation protocol for structured observations, provenance, temporal state,
  reference frames, bounded recall, reconciliation, and optional active
  evidence. The release contains a dependency-free reference implementation and
  deterministic validation harness; the registered campaign is pending.
keywords:
  - structured agent memory
  - temporal state
  - provenance
  - bounded recall
  - reconciliation
  - model-agnostic systems
  - reproducibility
